              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "a rede — \"the network; the net\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Não há rede aqui na aldeia. There is no signal here in the village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Estar na rede — to be online; as redes sociais — social media. Also a fishing net."
